<title>SINGAPORE: Kian Ann Engineering half-yr net up.</title>
<headline>Kian Ann Engineering half-yr net up.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to 31 Dec 96</p>
<p>(in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			     29.70 vs 21.89</p>
<p>Group shr (cents)		     2.48 vs  1.82</p>
<p>    Turnover				 39.26 vs 32.87</p>
<p>    Other income incl. interest	 0.33 vs  0.01</p>
<p>    Interest (expense)		    0.29 vs  0.41</p>
<p>Depreciation (expense)		0.41 vs  0.39</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			  4.28 vs  3.25</p>
<p>    Tax					 1.30 vs  1.07</p>
<p>    Minorities				0.01 vs  0.00</p>
<p>Note - Kian Ann Engineering is principally engaged in the procurement and distribution of industrial machinery spares and diesel engine parts. -- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
</text>
